────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
A note on the generated images
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Sixteen of the eighteen images under design/assets/ were generated with
Google's Nano Banana Pro (gemini-3-pro-image) from the prompts recorded in
design/assets/PROMPTS.md, and carry an invisible SynthID watermark identifying
them as AI-generated. The two textures were produced procedurally by
scripts/generate-textures.mjs, with no model involved and so no watermark.
None of them depicts a real person, venue or event.

TURBINE is a fictional festival created as teaching material. Artist names,
copy and imagery are invented. Any resemblance to a real event or performer
is coincidental.
